Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 16:18:39 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] dt-bindings: input: cypress,tm2-touchkey: add Coreriver
 TC305K

The Coreriver TC305K drives the Recent and Back touch keys of the
Samsung Galaxy Tab S3. It uses the same I2C protocol as the TC360, but
reports key presses and releases as a bitmap.

Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5
---

Notes:
    dt_binding_check was not run.

 .../devicetree/bindings/input/cypress,tm2-touchkey.yaml          | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

